@startuml
' Transfer21.10: Analyst2736e28 + Owner passive SVG / aspect reading / first-five.
title HTML selection, full-source S1 and aspect return
autonumber
hide footbox
actor User
control "Accepted source / selection" as Facts
participant "Retained HTML controls" as HTML
participant "Page / editor mode" as Page
participant "Passive SVG" as Wheel
Facts -> Facts : index ALL accepted aspects by unordered IDs + published type
alt >1 source matches (S1)
 Facts -> HTML : keep source rows/order/facts; accessible local warning
 Facts -> HTML : disable only ambiguous aspect activation
 Facts -> Wheel : suppress only ambiguous line/conjunction
 opt selected address became absent or ambiguous
  Facts -> Facts : clear only aspect; restore disclosures, no planet filter
  Facts -> Page : exit reading, preserve draft and unaffected facts
 end
else unique address (including unique reverse)
 Facts -> Facts : address selection using new facts and original from/to
end
User -> HTML : native point activation, pointer / Enter / Space
HTML -> Facts : canonical point ID
alt repeated selected point
 Facts -> Facts : selection none; aspects first5
else another point / previously selected aspect
 Facts -> Facts : point replaces previous selection
 Facts -> HTML : all source aspects of ID, no limit5
end
Facts -> HTML : keyed patch; points disclosure preserved
Facts -> Wheel : passive emphasis, no HTTP
note over HTML, Wheel
Point activation does not call focus/scroll.
SVG has no intents, tab stops, selectable targets or SVG Q44 controls.
HTML keyboard access / effective Q44 remain required.
end note
User -> HTML : activate unique aspect row
HTML -> Facts : canonical aspect address
Facts -> Facts : save all three disclosure values; clear point filter
Facts -> Page : enter reading; recovery/return stay reachable
Facts -> HTML : one aspect, all source participants, only their source houses
Facts -> Wheel : selected pair / true endpoints; background no line or marker
Facts -> HTML : focus/scroll to reading region; record live origin
opt current frame settled and user still in reading region
 Facts -> HTML : adjust scroll after reflow, never from retired callback
end
User -> HTML : return / Escape / same aspect row
HTML -> Facts : close reading / clear aspect
Facts -> Page : restore normal page and editor visibility
Facts -> Wheel : complete composition
Facts -> HTML : previous independent points/houses/aspects disclosures
Facts -> HTML : focus retained live origin control
opt a normal table has >5 rows
 User -> HTML : toggle first5 / all for this table
 HTML -> Facts : update only this disclosure
 Facts -> HTML : source rows, no sort / recompute / HTTP
end
note over Facts, Wheel
S1 cardinality is full-source, BEFORE any display subset or filter.
Unknown time / angles receive no invented house.
Late return to unique enables selection, never auto-reselects.
Failed reads do not reconcile unaccepted data; acceptance is001/003.
end note
@enduml
